This software reads, and its results are measured on, artefacts released by the Allen
Institute for AI and collaborators. None of that data is redistributed here: each user
downloads it with `consilience-ai2 fetch`, which pins every source by SHA-256 or git
commit (consilience_ai2/fetch/sources.yaml). This repository ships only its own code,
small synthetic fixtures written for it, derived numbers, and short excerpts (at most a
sentence or two each) quoted as receipts in the analysis detail files
(analyses/receipts/examples.json, analyses/audit/details/*.json), under the licences
below. File formats are read as documented by the projects below; no code or data file
from them is included.

